# SHA-256 of the DER test-CA roots that may be installed into mroot of a КриптоАРМ Server stand.
# Used by scripts/fetch-test-certs.sh (download check) and scripts/issue-test-cert.sh (the issuer it
# fetches over plain http from the certificate's AIA URL must be one of these).
# Format: <sha256>  <file name in docker/cryptoarm-server/certs/root>. When the CA rolls its key,
# check the new root out of band (e.g. its thumbprint on https://www.cryptopro.ru) before adding it.
